        "prefix_token_count": 261,
        "step_number": 3,
        "text": "Step 3: Since \\(f(x) = x^3 + 3x^2 + 1\\), then \\(f(a) = a^3 + 3a^2 + 1\\). Therefore, the left side of the equation becomes:\n\\[\nf(x) - f(a) = (x^3 + 3x^2 + 1) - (a^3 + 3a^2 + 1) = x^3 + 3x^2 - a^3 - 3a^2.\n\\]"
