        "prefix_token_count": 325,
        "step_number": 4,
        "text": "Step 4: Equate the coefficients from both sides of the equation:\n\\[\nx^3 + 3x^2 - a^3 - 3a^2 = x^3 - (2a+b)x^2 + (2ab+a^2)x - a^2b.\n\\]"
