        "prefix_token_count": 437,
        "step_number": 5,
        "text": "Step 5: From the coefficient of \\(x^2\\), we have:\n\\[\n3 = -(2a + b).\n\\]\nFrom the constant term, we have:\n\\[\n-a^3 - 3a^2 = -a^2b \\implies a^3 + 3a^2 = a^2b \\implies a^2(a + 3) = a^2b \\implies a + 3 = b \\quad (\\text{since } a \\neq 0).\n\\]"
