        "prefix_token_count": 521,
        "step_number": 6,
        "text": "Step 6: Substitute \\(b = a + 3\\) into the equation for the coefficient of \\(x^2\\):\n\\[\n3 = -(2a + (a + 3)) \\implies 3 = -(3a + 3) \\implies 3 = -3a - 3 \\implies 6 = -3a \\implies a = -2.\n\\]"
